          "quote": "We select candidate unbound ejected stars with exactly the criterion as bound stars\n(eq. [1]), except reversing the sign on the second condition,v _ { \\odot - \\mathrm { c i r c l e } } \\ \\geq \\ v _ { \\mathrm { e s c } }, and of course\ndemanding that they be exiting rather than entering the Galaxy."
